    "long_instructions": "# Wireframes → Webpages\r\n\r\n**Your Goal:** Use your wireframe and a planned prompt to generate the webpages with AI, then refine it to better match your design.\r\n\r\n:::details [**Step 1: Plan Your Prompt**]\r\n\r\n- Open `prompt.md` and using your wireframe from last class to help you complete the ROPE sections to plan your prompt.\r\n- If you don’t have a wireframe, use the Sample Wireframe provided in the file panel.\r\n:::\r\n\r\n:::details [**Step 2: Generate with AI**]\r\n\r\n- Add your wireframe from your Backpack\r\n  - Add the Sample Wireframe if you don't have a wireframe from last class\r\n- Use your `prompt.md` to write your prompt\r\n- Run your prompt and review the result.\r\n- Accept the output when you're ready to move forward. \r\n\r\n**Make sure your prompt:**\r\n- Clearly describes the layout and structure  \r\n- Includes key constraints from your wireframe  \r\n- Considers at least one accessibility need (POUR)\r\n\r\n:::\r\n\r\n:::details [**Step 3: Compare Your Design to the Output**]\r\n\r\n- Record in your Activity Guide:\r\n  - Where the AI output **matches** your wireframe\r\n  - Where the AI output **does not match** your wireframe  \r\n- Focus on layout and structure.\r\n\r\n:::\r\n\r\n:::details [**Step 4: Focus Your Revision**]\r\n\r\n- Choose **ONE mismatch** to improve.\r\n  - Describe what should be different in your webpage (update this in `prompt.md`).\r\n  - Plan how you will update your prompt  \r\n\r\n- Then:\r\n  - Prompt AI to revise your layout  \r\n  - Refine until your layout better aligns with your wireframe\r\n  - Revert to a previous version if a revision moves your layout further from your wireframe\r\n  - Answer the reflection questions in your Activity Guide \r\n\r\n:::\r\n\r\n\r\n:::details [**If Time Allows**]\r\n\r\n- Choose a second mismatch and refine it  \r\n- Improve one accessibility issue using POUR  \r\n- Try a different prompt (more detail, clearer structure, or added context)  \r\n\r\n:::",
